work terminal_states_make_wrong_triage_irreversible
  target_plane run4_institutional_fabric
  priority 8.0
  reason invalidated is terminal by design, so a mistaken closure cannot be undone -- these items had to be recreated instead. The design is right for honesty and wrong for recovery. A reopened item should be able to cite what it supersedes, or triage needs a reversible provisional state distinct from invalidated
